Negative control for filter-format-dispatch.test.ts.

Points the toggle group's tester at the OTHER tri-state format, so no filter
renderer claims the leaf that asks for a toggle group and the column falls to the
generic control for its type — a raw select of `true`/`false`/`null`. Any
assertion that reads WHICH control the declared format drew goes red; one that
merely asserts a control rendered, or counts the bar's positions, stays green.

